WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,170
K1 base is a nice girl

2
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,930
Never go to K1 base

3
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,210
It won't work there

4
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:10,830
It's so far away from our remaining base, little girl.

5
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:12,990
A is the K1 base World University

6
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,390
Not a good place

7
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:16,870
If you can come, the rest of us will be lucky.

8
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:21,260
Don't jump into the fire pit, no need to persuade

9
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:23,150
Join my base

10
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:24,870
You have to participate in production every day

11
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,030
What's your job?

12
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,990
