13
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:30,530
Farming, raising pigs, raising chickens

14
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:32,050
Catching insects to build a house

15
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:33,130
You can do whatever you want

16
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:35,490
But they all have to work and I want it too

17
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:38,210
I help my parents teach me how to cook and feed the pigs every day.

18
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:41,290
Otherwise, I’ll give you ten seconds without turning over the food.

19
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:43,890
Those who are willing to stay and those who are unwilling to leave quickly
